<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten products unchanged in slow trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten products unchanged in slow trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten product values were unchanged Friday in fairly slow trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's Friday and we see most activity at the beginning of the week,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today	 Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq     -    unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   78.00     78.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  345.00    345.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   70.00     70.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
